# The gantry link's limit: its latency. The partner's velocity feeds the
# fast loop, where the fight is (200 Hz): 1 ms still holds, 3 ms (15 rt
# cycles, sampled at 1 kHz: a relay through LinuxCNC and smart-serial)
# brings the fight back. Hence a drive-to-drive link (CAN), not LinuxCNC.
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/retrofit/laser3015_glink.portal
glink 15 5
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 0.5 300 1400
run 0.3
mark
move 4 300 1480
print max_cur_y1
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 > 5
@reject ^ERROR
